From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:47:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] PhotoGIMP Pro: Alt toggles zoom out in the zoom tool
 (Photoshop)

---
 app/tools/gimpmagnifytool.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/tools/gimpmagnifytool.c b/app/tools/gimpmagnifytool.c
index e0ddac6..f3b2d87 100644
--- a/app/tools/gimpmagnifytool.c
+++ b/app/tools/gimpmagnifytool.c
@@ -235,7 +235,7 @@ gimp_magnify_tool_modifier_key (GimpTool        *tool,
 {
   GimpMagnifyOptions *options = GIMP_MAGNIFY_TOOL_GET_OPTIONS (tool);
 
-  if (key == gimp_get_toggle_behavior_mask ())
+  if (key == GDK_MOD1_MASK /* PhotoGIMP Pro: Alt = zoom out (Photoshop) */)
     {
       switch (options->zoom_type)
         {
